      }
    ],
    "releaseDate": "11/16/2026",
    "description": "Collects PSI (pressure stall information) for CPU, memory and IO from /proc/pressure: some/full averages over 10s/60s/300s, including per-cgroup v2 pressure files when present. Emits JSON events to index=main (sourcetype psi:status) every 60s and psi_* metrics to index=metrics (sourcetype psi:metrics), with dashboards.",
